d-start","name":"ç©å®¶å›åˆå¼€å§‹","description":"ç©å®¶å›åˆå¼€å§‹é˜¶æ®µ","from":"ç³»ç»Ÿ","mark":"PlayerRoundStart","initEventCode":"(async (context, gameProcess) => {\n\t//é€šçŸ¥ç©å®¶å›åˆ\n\tgameProcess.roundTurnNotify(context.currentRoundPlayer.id);\n}) as GameEventFunction<PlayerRoundStartContext>;"},{"id":"sys-phase-roll-dice","name":"ç©å®¶æ“ä½œ","description":"ç©å®¶æ“ä½œé˜¶æ®µ","from":"ç³»ç»Ÿ","mark":"RollDice","initEventCode":"(async (context, gameProcess) => {\n\tconst currentPlayer = context.currentRoundPlayer;\n\n\t// ä½¿ç”¨å¾ªç¯æ¥å¤„ç†å¯èƒ½çš„å¤šæ¬¡æ“ä½œï¼Œç›´åˆ°ç©å®¶æ·éª°å­æˆ–è¶…æ—¶\n\twhile (true) {\n\t\tgameProcess.setCurrentEventName(`ç­‰å¾…${currentPlayer.name}æ“ä½œ`);\n\n\t\tconst operation = await Promise.race([\n\t\t\tgameProcess.oncePlayerOperationAsync(currentPlayer.id, OperateType.RollDice)\n\t\t\t\t.then((res) => ({ type: OperateType.RollDice, res })),\n\t\t\tgameProcess.oncePlayerOperationAsync(currentPlayer.id, OperateType.UseChanceCard)\n\t\t\t\t.then((res) => ({ type: OperateType.UseChanceCard, res })),\n\t\t]);\n\n\t\tgameProcess.removePlayerAllOperationListener(currentPlayer.id, OperateType.RollDice);\n\t\tgameProcess.removePlayerAllOperationListener(currentPlayer.id, OperateType.UseChanceCard);\n\n\t\tif (operation.type === OperateType.RollDice) {\n\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tif (operation.res) {\n\t\t\tconst { chanceCardId, targetIdList } = operation.res;\n\t\t\tawait gameProcess.handleUseChanceCard(currentPlayer, chanceCardId, targetIdList);\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t// å°†éª°å­ç»“æœå†™å…¥ä¸Šä¸‹æ–‡ï¼Œå¹¶å­˜å‚¨åˆ°ç©å®¶å¯¹è±¡ä¸­ä¾›å…¶ä»–æœºåˆ¶ä½¿ç”¨\n\tconst diceResult = await currentPlayer.rollDices();\n\tcontext.diceResult = diceResult;\n}) as GameEventFunction<RollDiceContext>;\n"},{"id":"sys-phase-player-move","name":"ç©å®¶ç§»åŠ¨","description":"ç©å®¶ç§»åŠ¨é˜¶æ®µ","from":"ç³»ç»Ÿ","mark":"PlayerMove","initEventCode":"(async (context, gameProcess) => {\n\t//ç©å®¶ç§»åŠ¨\n\tconst player = context.currentRoundPlayer;\n\taw